{"seq":3,"slug":"server-side-wasm","title":"服务端 WASM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/wasi-and-beyond/server-side-wasm","wordCount":908,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"服务端-wasm\">服务端 WASM</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>WASM 的价值不止于浏览器：<strong>服务端 WASM 的核心卖点是亚毫秒级冷启动、KB 级体积与强隔离</strong>。运行时层面，<code>Wasmtime</code> 和 <code>Wasmer</code> 是最成熟的两位选手，可嵌入 Rust/Go/Python 等宿主语言。框架层面，Spin 让每个 HTTP 请求跑在独立沙箱中；边缘计算平台（Cloudflare Workers、Fastly Compute）借它把计算下沉到全球节点。作为容器形态，WASM 容器体积以 KB 计、启动近于瞬时，已能与 Docker 相提并论。但要看清适用面：它适合无状态的计算密集型服务，复杂有状态服务仍应由传统容器承担。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"wasmtime-与-wasmer-运行时\">Wasmtime 与 Wasmer 运行时</h2><p>WASM 在服务端的运行依赖独立的运行时引擎。Wasmtime 和 Wasmer 是两个最成熟的选择。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 Wasmtime&#10;curl https://wasmtime.dev/install.sh -sSf | bash&#10;&#10;# 运行 WASI 程序&#10;wasmtime run --dir /data my_program.wasm&#10;&#10;# 安装 Wasmer&#10;curl https://get.wasmer.io -sSfL | sh&#10;&#10;# 运行 WASI 程序&#10;wasmer run --dir /data my_program.wasm\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 Wasmtime</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://wasmtime.dev/install.sh</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -sSf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 运行 WASI 程序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasmtime</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /data</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my_program.wasm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 Wasmer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://get.wasmer.io</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -sSfL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 运行 WASI 程序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasmer</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /data</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my_program.wasm</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Wasmtime</th>\n<th>Wasmer</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开发者</td>\n<td>Bytecode Alliance</td>\n<td>Wasmer Inc.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译后端</td>\n<td>Cranelift</td>\n<td>LLVM / Singlepass / Cranelift</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WASI 支持</td>\n<td>Preview 1 + 2</td>\n<td>Preview 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组件模型</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n<td>⚠️ 部分支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌入语言</td>\n<td>Rust/C/Python/Go/.NET</td>\n<td>Rust/C/Python/Go/JS/PHP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>启动速度</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>极快（Singlepass）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优化程度</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包管理</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>WAPM（Wasmer 包管理）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// Rust 中嵌入 Wasmtime&#10;use wasmtime::*;&#10;&#10;fn main() -&gt; anyhow::Result&lt;()&gt; {&#10;    let engine = Engine::default();&#10;    let module = Module::from_file(&amp;engine, &quot;my_program.wasm&quot;)?;&#10;&#10;    let mut linker = Linker::new(&amp;engine);&#10;    wasmtime_wasi::add_to_linker(&amp;mut linker, |s| s)?;&#10;&#10;    let wasi = wasmtime_wasi::WasiCtxBuilder::new()&#10;        .inherit_stdio()&#10;        .preopened_dir(&quot;/host/data&quot;, &quot;/data&quot;)?&#10;        .build();&#10;&#10;    let mut store = Store::new(&amp;engine, wasi);&#10;    let instance = linker.instantiate(&amp;mut store, &amp;module)?;&#10;&#10;    let func = instance.get_typed_func::&lt;(i32, i32), i32&gt;(&amp;mut store, &quot;add&quot;)?;&#10;    let result = func.call(&amp;mut store, (3, 5))?;&#10;    println!(&quot;3 + 5 = {}&quot;, result);&#10;&#10;    Ok(())&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Rust 中嵌入 Wasmtime</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use wasmtime::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() -> anyhow::Result&#x3C;()> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let engine = Engine::default();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let module = Module::from_file(&#x26;engine, \"my_program.wasm\")?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut linker = Linker::new(&#x26;engine);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    wasmtime_wasi::add_to_linker(&#x26;mut linker, |s| s)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let wasi = wasmtime_wasi::WasiCtxBuilder::new()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .inherit_stdio()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .preopened_dir(\"/host/data\", \"/data\")?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .build();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut store = Store::new(&#x26;engine, wasi);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let instance = linker.instantiate(&#x26;mut store, &#x26;module)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let func = instance.get_typed_func::&#x3C;(i32, i32), i32>(&#x26;mut store, \"add\")?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let result = func.call(&#x26;mut store, (3, 5))?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"3 + 5 = {}\", result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Wasmtime 的 Cranelift 编译器在代码质量和编译速度之间取得了很好的平衡。对于冷启动敏感的场景（如 Serverless），可以使用预编译模块（<code>wasmtime compile</code>）跳过运行时编译阶段。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"spin-fermyon-框架\">Spin / Fermyon 框架</h2><p>Spin 是 Fermyon 开发的 WASM 微服务框架，让开发者用 WASM 组件构建 HTTP 服务。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use spin_sdk::http::{IntoResponse, Request, Response};&#10;use spin_sdk::http_component;&#10;&#10;#[http_component]&#10;fn handle_request(req: Request) -&gt; anyhow::Result&lt;impl IntoResponse&gt; {&#10;    let path = req.uri().path();&#10;&#10;    match path {&#10;        &quot;/&quot; =&gt; Ok(Response::builder()&#10;            .status(200)&#10;            .header(&quot;content-type&quot;, &quot;text/html&quot;)&#10;            .body(&quot;你好，WASM 世界！&quot;)?),&#10;        &quot;/api/data&quot; =&gt; {&#10;            let data = serde_json::json!({&#10;                &quot;message&quot;: &quot;来自 WASM 的响应&quot;,&#10;                &quot;timestamp&quot;: chrono::Utc::now().to_rfc3339(),&#10;            });&#10;            Ok(Response::builder()&#10;                .status(200)&#10;                .header(&quot;content-type&quot;, &quot;application/json&quot;)&#10;                .body(data.to_string())?)&#10;        }&#10;        _ =&gt; Ok(Response::builder()&#10;            .status(404)&#10;            .body(&quot;Not Found&quot;)?),&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use spin_sdk::http::{IntoResponse, Request, Response};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use spin_sdk::http_component;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[http_component]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn handle_request(req: Request) -> anyhow::Result&#x3C;impl IntoResponse> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let path = req.uri().path();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match path {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"/\" => Ok(Response::builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .status(200)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .header(\"content-type\", \"text/html\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .body(\"你好，WASM 世界！\")?),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"/api/data\" => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let data = serde_json::json!({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                \"message\": \"来自 WASM 的响应\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                \"timestamp\": chrono::Utc::now().to_rfc3339(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Ok(Response::builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .status(200)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .header(\"content-type\", \"application/json\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .body(data.to_string())?)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _ => Ok(Response::builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .status(404)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .body(\"Not Found\")?),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# spin.toml&#10;spin_manifest_version = 2&#10;&#10;[application]&#10;name = &quot;my-wasm-api&quot;&#10;version = &quot;0.1.0&quot;&#10;&#10;[[trigger.http]]&#10;route = &quot;/...&quot;&#10;component = &quot;api-handler&quot;&#10;&#10;[component.api-handler]&#10;source = &quot;target/wasm32-wasi/release/my_api.wasm&quot;&#10;[component.api-handler.build]&#10;command = &quot;cargo build --target wasm32-wasi --release&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># spin.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>spin_manifest_version = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[application]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name = \"my-wasm-api\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>version = \"0.1.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[[trigger.http]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>route = \"/...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>component = \"api-handler\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[component.api-handler]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>source = \"target/wasm32-wasi/release/my_api.wasm\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[component.api-handler.build]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>command = \"cargo build --target wasm32-wasi --release\"</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    CLIENT[&quot;HTTP 客户端&quot;] --&gt; SPIN[&quot;Spin 运行时&quot;]&#10;    SPIN --&gt; ROUTE[&quot;路由匹配&quot;]&#10;    ROUTE --&gt; COMP1[&quot;组件 A: /api/*&quot;]&#10;    ROUTE --&gt; COMP2[&quot;组件 B: /auth/*&quot;]&#10;    ROUTE --&gt; COMP3[&quot;组件 C: /static/*&quot;]&#10;    COMP1 --&gt; WASI[&quot;WASI 系统接口&quot;]&#10;    COMP2 --&gt; WASI&#10;    WASI --&gt; KV[&quot;Key-Value 存储&quot;]&#10;    WASI --&gt; DB[&quot;数据库&quot;]\">graph TD\n    CLIENT[\"HTTP 客户端\"] --&gt; SPIN[\"Spin 运行时\"]\n    SPIN --&gt; ROUTE[\"路由匹配\"]\n    ROUTE --&gt; COMP1[\"组件 A: /api/*\"]\n    ROUTE --&gt; COMP2[\"组件 B: /auth/*\"]\n    ROUTE --&gt; COMP3[\"组件 C: /static/*\"]\n    COMP1 --&gt; WASI[\"WASI 系统接口\"]\n    COMP2 --&gt; WASI\n    WASI --&gt; KV[\"Key-Value 存储\"]\n    WASI --&gt; DB[\"数据库\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>冷启动</td>\n<td>&lt; 1ms（对比容器的 100ms+）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存占用</td>\n<td>几 MB（对比容器的几十 MB）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多语言</td>\n<td>Rust/Go/Python/JavaScript</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组件隔离</td>\n<td>每个请求独立沙箱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态存储</td>\n<td>内置 Key-Value 和 SQLite</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署</td>\n<td>Fermyon Cloud / 自托管</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"边缘计算-cloudflare-workers\">边缘计算：Cloudflare Workers</h2><p>Cloudflare Workers 支持 WASM 模块，让计算在全球边缘节点执行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use worker::*;&#10;&#10;#[event(fetch)]&#10;async fn main(req: Request, env: Env, _ctx: Context) -&gt; Result&lt;Response&gt; {&#10;    Router::new()&#10;        .get_async(&quot;/api/process&quot;, |req, ctx| async move {&#10;            let data = process_data().await;&#10;            Response::ok(data)&#10;        })&#10;        .get(&quot;/health&quot;, |_, _| Response::ok(&quot;OK&quot;))&#10;        .run(req, env)&#10;        .await&#10;}&#10;&#10;async fn process_data() -&gt; String {&#10;    let values: Vec&lt;f64&gt; = (0..1000).map(|i| (i as f64).sin()).collect();&#10;    let sum: f64 = values.iter().sum();&#10;    format!(&quot;计算结果: {:.6}&quot;, sum)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use worker::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[event(fetch)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn main(req: Request, env: Env, _ctx: Context) -> Result&#x3C;Response> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Router::new()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .get_async(\"/api/process\", |req, ctx| async move {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let data = process_data().await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Response::ok(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .get(\"/health\", |_, _| Response::ok(\"OK\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .run(req, env)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .await</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn process_data() -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let values: Vec&#x3C;f64> = (0..1000).map(|i| (i as f64).sin()).collect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let sum: f64 = values.iter().sum();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    format!(\"计算结果: {:.6}\", sum)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>WASM 支持</th>\n<th>冷启动</th>\n<th>分布节点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cloudflare Workers</td>\n<td>V8 + WASM</td>\n<td>~0ms</td>\n<td>300+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fastly Compute</td>\n<td>Wasmtime</td>\n<td>~5ms</td>\n<td>80+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vercel Edge Functions</td>\n<td>V8 + WASM</td>\n<td>~1ms</td>\n<td>全球</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Deno Deploy</td>\n<td>V8 + WASM</td>\n<td>~1ms</td>\n<td>35+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fermyon Cloud</td>\n<td>Spin/Wasmtime</td>\n<td>&lt; 1ms</td>\n<td>增长中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    USER[&quot;用户请求&quot;] --&gt; CDN[&quot;边缘节点&lt;br/&gt;(最近的)&quot;]&#10;    CDN --&gt; WASM_WORKER[&quot;WASM Worker&quot;]&#10;    WASM_WORKER --&gt; KV_STORE[&quot;边缘 KV 存储&quot;]&#10;    WASM_WORKER --&gt; RESPONSE[&quot;响应&lt;br/&gt;(&lt; 10ms)&quot;]&#10;    RESPONSE --&gt; USER\">graph LR\n    USER[\"用户请求\"] --&gt; CDN[\"边缘节点&lt;br/&gt;(最近的)\"]\n    CDN --&gt; WASM_WORKER[\"WASM Worker\"]\n    WASM_WORKER --&gt; KV_STORE[\"边缘 KV 存储\"]\n    WASM_WORKER --&gt; RESPONSE[\"响应&lt;br/&gt;(&lt; 10ms)\"]\n    RESPONSE --&gt; USER</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Cloudflare Workers 的 WASM 模块大小限制为 1MB（免费套餐）或 10MB（付费套餐）。使用 <code>wasm-opt -Oz</code> 和 Brotli 压缩来控制体积。对于大型应用，考虑拆分为多个 Worker。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"wasm-容器化\">WASM 容器化</h2><p>WASM 正在成为容器的轻量级替代方案。&quot;如果 WASM 在 2008 年就存在，我们就不需要发明 Docker&quot;——Docker 联合创始人 Solomon Hykes。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 传统容器&#10;        APP_C[&quot;应用代码&quot;] --&gt; RUNTIME_C[&quot;语言运行时&quot;]&#10;        RUNTIME_C --&gt; OS_C[&quot;容器化 OS&quot;]&#10;        OS_C --&gt; KERNEL_C[&quot;宿主内核&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph WASM 容器&#10;        APP_W[&quot;WASM 模块&quot;] --&gt; WASI_W[&quot;WASI 运行时&quot;]&#10;        WASI_W --&gt; KERNEL_W[&quot;宿主内核&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 传统容器\n        APP_C[\"应用代码\"] --&gt; RUNTIME_C[\"语言运行时\"]\n        RUNTIME_C --&gt; OS_C[\"容器化 OS\"]\n        OS_C --&gt; KERNEL_C[\"宿主内核\"]\n    end\n    subgraph WASM 容器\n        APP_W[\"WASM 模块\"] --&gt; WASI_W[\"WASI 运行时\"]\n        WASI_W --&gt; KERNEL_W[\"宿主内核\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>Docker 容器</th>\n<th>WASM 容器</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>启动时间</td>\n<td>100ms - 数秒</td>\n<td>&lt; 1ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>镜像/模块大小</td>\n<td>数十 MB - 数 GB</td>\n<td>数 KB - 数 MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存开销</td>\n<td>数十 MB 基础开销</td>\n<td>几 MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全隔离</td>\n<td>命名空间 + cgroup</td>\n<td>类型安全 + 能力模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可移植性</td>\n<td>Linux 内核依赖</td>\n<td>完全平台无关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态成熟度</td>\n<td>✅ 非常成熟</td>\n<td>⚠️ 发展中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络支持</td>\n<td>✅ 完整</td>\n<td>⚠️ 有限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 使用 Docker + WASM (需要 Docker Desktop 4.15+)&#10;docker run --runtime=io.containerd.wasmtime.v1 \\&#10;  --platform=wasi/wasm \\&#10;  my-wasm-app&#10;&#10;# Kubernetes + WASM (通过 SpinKube)&#10;kubectl apply -f - &lt;&lt;EOF&#10;apiVersion: core.spinoperator.dev/v1alpha1&#10;kind: SpinApp&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: my-wasm-service&#10;spec:&#10;  image: ghcr.io/my-org/my-wasm-service:latest&#10;  replicas: 3&#10;EOF\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 Docker + WASM (需要 Docker Desktop 4.15+)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --runtime=io.containerd.wasmtime.v1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --platform=wasi/wasm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  my-wasm-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Kubernetes + WASM (通过 SpinKube)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apply</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EOF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apiVersion: core.spinoperator.dev/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kind: SpinApp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">metadata:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  name: my-wasm-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">spec:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  image: ghcr.io/my-org/my-wasm-service:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  replicas: 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EOF</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> WASM 容器目前最适合计算密集型的无状态微服务。对于需要复杂网络栈、数据库驱动或系统库的服务，传统容器仍然是更实际的选择。两者不是替代关系，而是互补。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((服务端 WASM))&#10;    运行时&#10;      Wasmtime / Wasmer&#10;      嵌入式使用&#10;      预编译优化&#10;    Spin 框架&#10;      HTTP 微服务&#10;      亚毫秒冷启动&#10;      多语言组件&#10;    边缘计算&#10;      Cloudflare Workers&#10;      全球分布&#10;      极低延迟&#10;    WASM 容器&#10;      替代 Docker 场景&#10;      KB 级模块&#10;      SpinKube 集成\">mindmap\n  root((服务端 WASM))\n    运行时\n      Wasmtime / Wasmer\n      嵌入式使用\n      预编译优化\n    Spin 框架\n      HTTP 微服务\n      亚毫秒冷启动\n      多语言组件\n    边缘计算\n      Cloudflare Workers\n      全球分布\n      极低延迟\n    WASM 容器\n      替代 Docker 场景\n      KB 级模块\n      SpinKube 集成</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Wasmtime</strong> 和 <strong>Wasmer</strong> 是最成熟的服务端 WASM 运行时，支持嵌入 Rust/Go/Python 等宿主语言。</li>\n<li><strong>Spin</strong> 框架实现亚毫秒级冷启动的 HTTP 微服务，每个请求在独立沙箱中执行。</li>\n<li><strong>边缘计算</strong>平台（Cloudflare Workers/Fastly Compute）利用 WASM 在全球节点实现超低延迟。</li>\n<li>WASM 容器以 KB 级体积和亚毫秒启动挑战 Docker，Docker Desktop 已内置 WASM 运行时支持。</li>\n<li>WASM 容器适合<strong>无状态计算密集型</strong>服务，复杂有状态服务仍建议使用传统容器。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"服务端 WASM","id":"服务端-wasm"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Wasmtime 与 Wasmer 运行时","id":"wasmtime-与-wasmer-运行时"},{"level":2,"text":"Spin / Fermyon 框架","id":"spin-fermyon-框架"},{"level":2,"text":"边缘计算：Cloudflare Workers","id":"边缘计算-cloudflare-workers"},{"level":2,"text":"WASM 容器化","id":"wasm-容器化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"组件模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/wasi-and-beyond/component-model"},"next":{"title":"WASM GC 与未来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/wasi-and-beyond/wasm-gc-and-future"}}